{"id":"msg_1784310190071_5b56","role":"assistant","content":"","ts":"2026-07-17T17:43:10.071Z","toolCalls":[{"name":"Bash","args":{"command":"powershell -Command '\n# Check all services related to Realtek\nGet-Service -Name \"RtkAudio*\",\"RtkBt*\",\"Realtek*\",\"Rtk*\",\"RtkSrv*\" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Format-List Name,DisplayName,Status,StartType\nWrite-Host \"---\"\n# Also check if there are any Realtek processes\nGet-Process -Name \"Rtk*\",\"Realtek*\",\"RAVCpl*\",\"RtkNGUI*\",\"Rtk*\" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object Name,Id\nWrite-Host \"---\"\n# Check the audio endpoint builder service details\nGet-CimInstance Win32_Service -Filter \"Name='\"Audiosrv\"'\" | Select-Object Name,PathName,StartName,State\n'","description":"Check Realtek services and processes"},"description":"Check Realtek services and processes","status":"error","message":"Exit code 1\nGet-CimInstance : ��Ч��ѯ \r\n����λ�� ��:9 �ַ�: 1\r\n+ Get-CimInstance Win32_Service -Filter \"Name=Audiosrv\" | Select-Object ...\r\n+ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n    + CategoryInfo          : InvalidArgument: (:) [Get-CimInstance]��CimException\r\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : HRESULT 0x80041017,Microsoft.Management.Infrastructure.CimCmdlets.GetCimInstanceCommand\r\n \r\n---\n---\n"},{"name":"Bash","args":{"command":"powershell -Command '\n# Check current audio format for the speakers device\n$path = \"HKLM:\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\MMDevices\\Audio\\Render\\{f9618bdc-9058-42c1-9180-b6f398a77bb1}\\Properties\"\n$fmtMask = (Get-ItemProperty -Path $path -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue).\"{b3f8fa53-0004-438e-9003-51a46e139bfc},0\"\n$fmtMask2 = (Get-ItemProperty -Path $path -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue).\"{b3f8fa53-0004-438e-9003-51a46e139bfc},1\"\nWrite-Host \"Format mask 0: $fmtMask\"\nWrite-Host \"Format mask 1: $fmtMask2\"\n\n# Check the {1da5d803-d492-4edd-8c23-e0c0ffee7f0e} properties for connection type\n$connectorType = (Get-ItemProperty